{
  "summary": "This experiment tested a multimodal model integrating image data (imagenet_vit_l encoder) with the existing RNA-only baseline (scvi_n200 + transformer aggregation), achieving higher validation accuracy (0.725) and F1 (0.685). The results suggest multimodal integration may improve performance, though the exact contribution of image data versus other factors remains uncertain. The impact of the weighted fusion strategy is not isolated."
}

